latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141025162346","caption":"Principal Mimizu на горячих источниках","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d2/Mimizu_hot_springs.png/revision/latest?cb=20141025162346"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Mimizu_and_moripakucoffret.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/Mimizu_and_moripakucoffret.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141025162313","caption":"Principal Mimizu с микрогруппой MoriPakuCoffret","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/Mimizu_and_moripakucoffret.png/revision/latest?cb=20141025162313"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-09-06_00-36-15-133.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bd/Bandicam_2018-09-06_00-36-15-133.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181005083732","caption":"Principal Mimizu в одной из вступительных тем Tamagotchi!","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bd/Bandicam_2018-09-06_00-36-15-133.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181005083732"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-10-10_16-17-27-529.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e1/Bandicam_2018-10-10_16-17-27-529.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181010202210","caption":"Снимок экрана · Principal Mimizu","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e1/Bandicam_2018-10-10_16-17-27-529.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181010202210"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2019-05-30_16-20-19-067.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Bandicam_2019-05-30_16-20-19-067.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20190602163425","caption":"Снимок экрана · Principal Mimizu","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Bandicam_2019-05-30_16-20-19-067.png/revision/latest?cb=20190602163425"},{"file":"https:/